+			"lines": "295-330",
+			"claim": "clearReplayCheckpoint (replay intent publication) is only reached from the replay branch, so a guarded-out call no longer clears the durable checkpoint before deciding."
+		},
+		{
+			"path": "packages/agent/src/harness/runtime/drive/tools.ts",
+			"lines": "350-450",
+			"claim": "performToolInvocation is the effect boundary: prepare/replay hands it the resolved declaration, so an undefined declaration would reach executeToolCall and fail there under the original code."
+		},
+		{
